WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.140
On a computer, Grok works right in your web browser,

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.070
so there's nothing to install.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.840
Tap 'Copy prompt and open Grok'.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.820
Grok opens in a new tab.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.100
Sign in, or make a free account.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.640
Click the message box, press Control V,

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.670
or Command V on a Mac, then Enter.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.224
Your trainer says hi, and walks you through the rest.

